# Shared: the login screen, character select, the world. Included by every scenario; not run on its own.
# antprox /REPLAY serves Karen (slot 0, Jupiter). Events are antprox.out's lines (the replay server's).
# the start-up movie (eb_sizzle.bik) plays about 77 s and input does not end it in the POC: the link leaves
# MovieClientClass::Handle_Input (tsk_smovie.obj's call) unresolved
wait-event stubs '^POC BINKMovie::Play: playing' within 60
wait-event antprox 'Global connection #1: sent VERSION_RESPONSE' within 240
# the login screen takes its first clicks a moment after the client's version check (no log line for "drawn" yet)
alive 3
click gadget login.username
text tester
click gadget login.password
text secret
click gadget login.ok
wait-event antprox 'sent GLOBAL_AVATAR_LIST' within 30
# character select builds its avatars after the list (no log line for "ready" yet)
alive 12
click gadget select.slot0
alive 2
click gadget select.enter
wait-event antprox 'received START_ACK' within 120
